OL,3,GNEWSACrossbow-wielding arsonist
OL,4,Adetained indefinitely
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crossbow-wielding arsonist who was
OL,7,Fmotivated by extreme right-wing
OL,8,Fideology to target an Indian restaurant
OL,9,Fand 5G masts has been detained.
OL,11,FProfessional artist Milo Creese, 40,
OL,12,Fhad faced charges of arson with intent
OL,13,Fto endanger life, arson, damaging
OL,14,Fproperty, having an offensive weapon in
OL,15,Fpublic and two assaults on an emergency
OL,16,Fworker.
OL,18,FA jury at the Old Bailey found Creese,
OL,19,Fof Murray Road in Ottershaw, Surrey,
OL,20,Fnot guilty of the charges by reason of
OL,21,Finsanity in September.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
